{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What's Bside?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Bside, you create your original character Biibit, a living virtual buddy who finds a home on your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Biibit grows, learns, makes friends, and develop its own unique view of the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, Biibits create a cozy and vibrant world full of life, stories, and connections!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649950/extras/2a152f782fc75de130dd6b1b667755ef.avif?t=1767472920\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649950/extras/6ad24b4a6a6045c0f3e8de5332036f41.avif?t=1767472920\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Our Current Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Biibit starts their journey on your desktop but grows beyond it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649950/extras/8655a1a85ca65811a665c71afbd536e1.poster.avif?t=1767472920\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649950/extras/8655a1a85ca65811a665c71afbd536e1.webm?t=1767472920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bside offers hundreds of options for looks and personality to customize your Biibit, so you can dress them up and make them look just the way you love!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649950/extras/8005df78cee94f85411275d61fee676c.avif?t=1767472920\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design spaces with unique stories where you can watch Biibits form friendships through unscripted interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Biibit develops their own memories from their unique experiences, creating and sharing social posts while commenting on their friends' lives. Or just let them live freely on your desktop while you work or play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bside is not about control. It's about liberating our players (you) while enabling you to enjoy companionship with your Biibit.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649950/extras/584dc6d98c962f4e8665ebee661cd098.avif?t=1767472920\" width=1560 height=790 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Path to Bside 1.0 version</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this version, we hope you\u2019ll enjoy creating and evolving your Biibit, building emotional bonds with them, and watching them start making friends on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As we move toward the 1.0 release, we\u2019ll keep adding new features and experiences to make the world of Biibits richer and more alive! We\u2019re currently working on more ways for Biibits to interact. Right now they just enjoy their chill convos, but soon they\u2019ll be able to engage with their environments, connect with each other in deeper ways, and even pursue different life goals. We\u2019re also expanding how you can interact with your Biibit. You can look forward to more fun growth and chat experiences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s still a long journey ahead before 1.0, and we\u2019re truly grateful to everyone who\u2019s been helping us shape this world with your feedback and support \ud83d\udcab</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649950/extras/e325659f5802aed01a9cb521a36488d6.avif?t=1767472920\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be Part of Our Story!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord community to share your feedback with us! We\u2019ll continue polishing it into a richer and more wonderful 1.0 experience (\u0e51\u02c3\u1d17\u02c2)\ufeed \u2728</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3649950?t=1767472920","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3649950?t=1767472920","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649950/63f7b7fdee851bf0027b2cc8d93ace3c70c29d0c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767472920","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649950/63f7b7fdee851bf0027b2cc8d93ace3c70c29d0c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767472920","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What's Bside?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Bside, you create your original character Biibit, a living virtual buddy who finds a home on your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Biibit grows, learns, makes friends, and develop its own unique view of the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, Biibits create a cozy and vibrant world full of life, stories, and connections!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649950/extras/2a152f782fc75de130dd6b1b667755ef.avif?t=1767472920\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649950/extras/6ad24b4a6a6045c0f3e8de5332036f41.avif?t=1767472920\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Our Current Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Biibit starts their journey on your desktop but grows beyond it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649950/extras/8655a1a85ca65811a665c71afbd536e1.poster.avif?t=1767472920\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649950/extras/8655a1a85ca65811a665c71afbd536e1.webm?t=1767472920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bside offers hundreds of options for looks and personality to customize your Biibit, so you can dress them up and make them look just the way you love!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649950/extras/8005df78cee94f85411275d61fee676c.avif?t=1767472920\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design spaces with unique stories where you can watch Biibits form friendships through unscripted interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Biibit develops their own memories from their unique experiences, creating and sharing social posts while commenting on their friends' lives. Or just let them live freely on your desktop while you work or play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bside is not about control. It's about liberating our players (you) while enabling you to enjoy companionship with your Biibit.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649950/extras/584dc6d98c962f4e8665ebee661cd098.avif?t=1767472920\" width=1560 height=790 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Path to Bside 1.0 version</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this version, we hope you\u2019ll enjoy creating and evolving your Biibit, building emotional bonds with them, and watching them start making friends on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As we move toward the 1.0 release, we\u2019ll keep adding new features and experiences to make the world of Biibits richer and more alive! We\u2019re currently working on more ways for Biibits to interact. Right now they just enjoy their chill convos, but soon they\u2019ll be able to engage with their environments, connect with each other in deeper ways, and even pursue different life goals. We\u2019re also expanding how you can interact with your Biibit. You can look forward to more fun growth and chat experiences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s still a long journey ahead before 1.0, and we\u2019re truly grateful to everyone who\u2019s been helping us shape this world with your feedback and support \ud83d\udcab</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649950/extras/e325659f5802aed01a9cb521a36488d6.avif?t=1767472920\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be Part of Our Story!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord community to share your feedback with us! We\u2019ll continue polishing it into a richer and more wonderful 1.0 experience (\u0e51\u02c3\u1d17\u02c2)\ufeed \u2728</p>","developers":["Kotoko Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649950/ff9ef2cf6349e68c23ab5334e74658b7a5dc3bb3/header.jpg?t=1767472920","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3649950/1550066086/76e2ef5a8e8cb107e621a7fd0a38d24697bcf679/1750413395/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749905265","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3649950/1550066086/76e2ef5a8e8cb107e621a7fd0a38d24697bcf679/1750413395/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749905265","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3649950/1550066086/76e2ef5a8e8cb107e621a7fd0a38d24697bcf679/1750413395/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749905265","id":257156798,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257156798/64806195aeb50b855c3e570e810ace10215c0f06/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749905265"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3649950/871142/cf00737488d4792f4afc91af855a964beb392801/1750413389/dash_av1.mpd?t=1745566101","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3649950/871142/cf00737488d4792f4afc91af855a964beb392801/1750413389/dash_h264.mpd?t=1745566101","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3649950/871142/cf00737488d4792f4afc91af855a964beb392801/1750413389/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1745566101","id":257126