7472920"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649950/1d20bf4f344bb636b8d60c4b42b4de5ed396f44d/ss_1d20bf4f344bb636b8d60c4b42b4de5ed396f44d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1767472920","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649950/1d20bf4f344bb636b8d60c4b42b4de5ed396f44d/ss_1d20bf4f344bb636b8d60c4b42b4de5ed396f44d.600x338.jpg?t=1767472920"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649950/bfbf6a2176595605751aeb08e1a626110f535899/ss_bfbf6a2176595605751aeb08e1a626110f535899.1920x1080.jpg?t=1767472920","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649950/bfbf6a2176595605751aeb08e1a626110f535899/ss_bfbf6a2176595605751aeb08e1a626110f535899.600x338.jpg?t=1767472920"}],"short_description":"In Bside, you create your original character Biibit, a living virtual buddy who finds a home on your desktop. Each Biibit grows, learns, makes friends, and develop its own unique view of the world. Together, Biibits create a cozy and vibrant world full of life, stories, and connections!","steam_appid":3649950,"support_info":{"email":"contact@bside.zone","url":"https://www.bside.zone/"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":"https://bside.zone/"}